format 1
adapter scanner 1
scene: treasure

target scan-gold
name: A gold bar
object: gold
atomdex: element
references: ref-openstax-ap-elements
blurb: Pure gold is just one kind of atom.

fun_fact:
    Gold is an element, and an element cannot be broken down by ordinary chemical means. A bar of pure gold holds nothing but gold atoms.

composition:
    {"symbol":"Au","note":"the only element in pure gold"}

target scan-diamond
name: A diamond
object: diamond
references: ref-openstax-chem-10-5
blurb: A crystal made of carbon atoms.

fun_fact:
    In a diamond, every carbon atom is bonded to its neighbours in one giant network. Chemists call that a covalent network solid.

composition:
    {"symbol":"C","note":"the only element in a diamond"}
